{
  "meta": {"source":"原子序、符號、中英文名稱:常見週期表資料;原子量:已逐一對照 IUPAC CIAAW《Standard Atomic Weights 2024》與 NIST《Atomic Weights and Isotopic Compositions》(2026-11-13 查證);分類、版面位置:依教科書常見的分法與排列;電子殼層排列:已對照 NIST 資料(經 Wikipedia 轉引,少數元素的電子排列是例外,已逐一寫出);顏色:CPK 慣例配色;趣味小知識:自行撰寫。","note":"原子量寫的是常用的簡約值(約 4~6 位有效數字);H、Li、B、C、N、O、Mg、Si、S、Cl、Br、Tl、Pb、Ar 在 IUPAC 表上是「區間」(隨自然界同位素組成而變),這裡取常規值,O 的 15.999 與 Tl 的 204.38 是區間四捨五入後的簡約值。沒有穩定同位素的元素沒有標準原子量,寫的是慣例用的質量數:Tc、Pm、Po 到 Pu 與 NIST 表一致;Am 以後以及 104~118 號是常見週期表的慣例值,超重元素(Bh、Hs、Mt、Ds、Rg、Cn、Fl)與 IAEA 核種資料裡半衰期最長的同位素不同,屬於慣例差異,不是錯誤。Zr、Gd 依 IUPAC 2024 修訂。電子殼層排列已於 2026-11-13 逐一對照 Wikipedia「Electron configurations of the elements」資料頁(其 1~104 號引用 NIST《Ground levels and ionization energies》與 Martin & Wiese《Atomic Spectroscopy》),118 個元素全部一致,包含銅、鉻、鈀、釓等例外排列;注意這是二手來源,NIST 原表因網站改版暫時取不到。103 號鐒在 NIST 與 CRC 都標為存疑;109~118 號從未實測,是理論預測值。radius 只是畫面用的示意大小,不是真實原子半徑;沒有寫的元素用殼層數估算。use 只有中文:英文版把知識與用途合成一句寫在 fact。","retrieved":"2026-11-13"},
  "categories": {
    "nonmetal": {"color":"#7ee8a2","name":{"zh":"非金屬","en":"Nonmetal"},"desc":{"zh":"不是金屬的元素,摸起來不閃亮、不太會導電。我們呼吸的氧、水裡的氫、鉛筆芯的碳都是非金屬,它們是生命的基本材料!","en":"Elements that are not metals: not shiny and they do not carry electricity well. Oxygen we breathe, hydrogen in water and carbon in pencils are nonmetals - the building blocks of life!"}},
    "noble": {"color":"#c9a7ff","name":{"zh":"稀有氣體","en":"Noble gas"},"desc":{"zh":"最「害羞」的氣體家族,幾乎不跟別人牽手(不起反應)。氦氣讓氣球飄起來,氖氣讓招牌發光!","en":"The shy gas family: they almost never bond with others. Helium lifts balloons and neon makes signs glow!"}},
    "alkali": {"color":"#ff8a80","name":{"zh":"鹼金屬","en":"Alkali metal"},"desc":{"zh":"又軟又活潑的金屬,軟到可以用刀切,遇到水會噗噗冒泡甚至爆炸!像鈉(食鹽裡有它)、鉀。","en":"Soft, super-active metals you can cut with a knife. In water they fizz or even explode! Like sodium (in table salt) and potassium."}},
    "alkaline": {"color":"#ffb36b","name":{"zh":"鹼土金屬","en":"Alkaline earth"},"desc":{"zh":"比鹼金屬穩重一點的金屬家族,像鈣(骨頭和牙齒)、鎂(煙火的亮白光)。","en":"Metals a bit calmer than the alkali family, like calcium (bones and teeth) and magnesium (bright white fireworks)."}},
    "transition": {"color":"#7cc4ff","name":{"zh":"過渡金屬","en":"Transition metal"},"desc":{"zh":"我們最熟悉的硬金屬,又硬又亮又會導電。鐵、銅、金、銀都在這一家,可以做成房子、電線和珠寶!","en":"The hard, shiny metals we know best. Iron, copper, gold and silver are here - used for buildings, wires and jewelry!"}},
    "post": {"color":"#9fd6c9","name":{"zh":"貧金屬","en":"Post-transition metal"},"desc":{"zh":"比較軟、熔點比較低的金屬,像鋁(鋁罐、鋁箔紙)、錫、鉛。","en":"Softer metals that melt more easily, like aluminum (cans and foil), tin and lead."}},
    "metalloid": {"color":"#e6e07a","name":{"zh":"類金屬","en":"Metalloid"},"desc":{"zh":"一半像金屬、一半像非金屬的「混血兒」。矽就是它,電腦和手機的晶片都靠它!","en":"Half metal, half nonmetal! Silicon is one - computer and phone chips are made from it."}},
    "halogen": {"color":"#ffe066","name":{"zh":"鹵素","en":"Halogen"},"desc":{"zh":"很愛搶別人電子的活潑元素,會跟金屬變成鹽。氯可以幫游泳池殺菌,氟會保護牙齒。","en":"Active elements that love grabbing electrons and make salts with metals. Chlorine cleans pools and fluorine protects teeth."}},
    "lanthanide": {"color":"#f7a8d8","name":{"zh":"鑭系","en":"Lanthanide"},"desc":{"zh":"一群長得很像的稀土金屬,手機螢幕和強力磁鐵會用到它們。","en":"A group of similar rare-earth metals used in phone screens and strong magnets."}},
    "actinide": {"color":"#e58bb0","name":{"zh":"錒系","en":"Actinide"},"desc":{"zh":"很重、大多帶有放射性的金屬,像鈾(核能發電的燃料)。很多是人造的,要小心使用!","en":"Heavy, mostly radioactive metals like uranium (fuel for nuclear power). Many are man-made and must be handled carefully!"}}
  },
  "elements": [
    {"z":1,"sym":"H","name":{"zh":"氫","en":"Hydrogen"},"mass":1.008,"cat":"nonmetal","row":1,"col":1,"shells":[1],"color":"#ffffff","radius":0.42,"fact":{"zh":"宇宙裡最多、最輕的元素!太陽就是靠氫變成氦在發光。","en":"The most common element in the universe. The Sun shines by turning hydrogen into helium."},"use":{"zh":"氫氣可以讓氣球飄起來,也能當燃料電池的能量來源。"}},
    {"z":2,"sym":"He","name":{"zh":"氦","en":"Helium"},"mass":4.0026,"cat":"noble","row":1,"col":18,"shells":[2],"color":"#d9ffff","radius":0.5,"fact":{"zh":"吸了氦氣聲音會變成唐老鴨!它比空氣輕,也不會燒起來。","en":"Breathe it in and your voice sounds like a duck! Lighter than air and never burns."},"use":{"zh":"用來灌氣球、冷卻醫院的核磁共振儀。"}},
    {"z":3,"sym":"Li","name":{"zh":"鋰","en":"Lithium"},"mass":6.94,"cat":"alkali","row":2,"col":1,"shells":[2,1],"color":"#cc80ff","radius":0.8,"fact":{"zh":"最輕的金屬,輕到可以浮在水上。","en":"The lightest metal. It powers phone and electric car batteries."},"use":{"zh":"手機和電動車的電池都靠它。"}},
